WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.622
Narrator: Watch Faisal.

2
00:00:01.722 --> 00:00:05.900
Narrator: STOP at the entrance, with the words.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.900
Faisal: Stop here please.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.400
Narrator: GO-MOVE into lane two - a big sweep, repeated.

5
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.400
Faisal: This way please.

6
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:32.830
Narrator: Then his supervisor radios a hold, and Faisal gives HOLD - steady, calm, and he tells the fans why they're waiting.

7
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:34.830
Faisal: Please wait here.

8
00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:50.407
Narrator: STOP.

9
00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:52.262
Narrator: GO-MOVE.

10
00:00:52.362 --> 00:00:53.190
Narrator: HOLD.
